    <div class="overline">Post-Cluster Description</div>
    <div class="section-title">Descriptor &amp; Criterion Dimensions</div>
    <div class="section-sub">These 16 dimensions go into <code>segmentation-profile.csv</code>. They are not used in clustering but are joined back after clusters are assigned to describe and name each segment. Criterion variables (like current tool) are used to validate that segments predict tool choice.</div>
    <div class="filter-row">
      <input type="text" class="search-input" id="pro-search" placeholder="Search dimensions..." oninput="filterDims('descriptor')">
      <button class="filter-btn active" id="pro-btn-all" onclick="setDimFilter('descriptor','all')">All</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" id="pro-btn-descriptor" onclick="setDimFilter('descriptor','descriptor')">Descriptor</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" id="pro-btn-criterion" onclick="setDimFilter('descriptor','criterion')">Criterion</button>
    </div>
    <div class="dim-grid" id="descriptor-grid"></div>
    <div class="result-count" id="pro-count"></div>
